{"id":"0f911a6b1b63f977","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-ml-test.md","title":"Martin-Löf 检验","display":"df-ml-test — Martin-Löf 检验","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-ml-test","aliases":["20-df-ml-test"],"display":"df-ml-test — Martin-Löf 检验","chapter":"11","section":"11.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 11.1.1(1)–(2)","source_pdf_pages":[221],"source_printed_pages":[190],"depends_on":["[[20-df-cantor-measure]]","[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-ml-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-ml-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ml-test — Martin-Löf 检验"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 11.1.1(1)–(2)"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>221</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>190</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(U_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\">\\(U=(U_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 为 Cantor 空间开类序列。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ml\\text{-}test}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MLtest}(U)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\\n[U_n=\\bigcup_{\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)\\in W_{f(n)}}[\\sigma]\\land\\mu(U_n)\\le2^{-n}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ml\\text{-}test}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MLtest}(U)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\\n[U_n=\\bigcup_{\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)\\in W_{f(n)}}[\\sigma]\\land\\mu(U_n)\\le2^{-n}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一个可计算索引函数统一给出全部开类；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 单独有效开不足以构成检验。检验不必预先嵌套，可取有限交得到嵌套等价检验。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 11.1.1(1)–(2)；印刷页 190；PDF 第 221 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cantor-measure","status":"resolved","id":"978bb51599bc5702","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-measure","status":"resolved","id":"978bb51599bc5702","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{